// Global lifecycle hooks, keyed by event. Tool events (`preToolUse`, `postToolUse`, `permissionRequest`, `toolResponseTransform`, `toolInputTransform`, `toolGuard`) take matchers that select tools by name; every other event takes a list of hooks. See https://docs.docker.com/ai/docker-agent/configuration/hooks/.
